### =========================
### V1 - RAW LLM OUTPUT (String / JSON text)
### =========================

### V1 - Paris travel plan (raw JSON text)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/travel?topic=Paris&days=3
Accept: text/plain

### V1 - Tokyo travel plan (raw JSON text)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/travel?topic=Tokyo&days=5
Accept: text/plain

###

### V1 - Default days (should use 3)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/travel?topic=Rome
Accept: text/plain

###

### V1 - Error case (missing topic → 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/travel?days=3
Accept: text/plain


### =========================
### V2 - STRUCTURED OUTPUT (TravelPlan object)
### =========================

### V2 - Paris travel plan (structured object)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/travel?topic=Paris&days=3
Accept: application/json

###

### V2 - Japan travel plan (structured object)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/travel?topic=Japan&days=7
Accept: application/json

###

### V2 - Default days (structured object)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/travel?topic=Barcelona
Accept: application/json

###

### V2 - Error case (missing topic → 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/travel?days=4
Accept: application/json

### =========================
### V3 - CHAT WITH MEMORY (SOTA 2026)
### =========================

### V3 - Start conversation (memory init)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v3/chat/user1
Content-Type: text/plain
Accept: text/plain

I want to travel to Japan

### V3 - Follow-up (should remember Japan)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v3/chat/user1
Content-Type: text/plain
Accept: text/plain

What food should I try?



### 2) Same session → context should be remembered (Japan)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v3/chat/user1
Content-Type: text/plain
Accept: text/plain

What are the best cities to visit in this country?

###

### 3) Same session → deeper contextual follow-up
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v3/chat?sessionId=user1&message=What%20activities%20should%20I%20do%20there%3F
Accept: text/plain

###

### 4) Same session → domain-specific follow-up (food)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v3/chat?sessionId=user1&message=What%20food%20should%20I%20try%3F
Accept: text/plain

###

### 5) New independent session (user2 → no memory shared)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v3/chat?sessionId=user2&message=Hi%2C%20I%20want%20to%20visit%20Japan
Accept: text/plain

###

### 6) user2 follow-up (only remembers its own context)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v3/chat?sessionId=user2&message=Give%20me%20a%203-day%20itinerary
Accept: text/plain

###

### 7) Back to user1 → memory continues (Japan context still active)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v3/chat?sessionId=user1&message=Give%20me%20a%203-day%20plan%20based%20on%20what%20we%20discussed
Accept: text/plain

### =========================
### V4 - FIRST REQUEST (create session memory)
### =========================

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v4/travel?sessionId=user1&days=3
Content-Type: text/plain
Accept: application/json

I want to travel to Japan

### =========================
### V4 - MEMORY UPDATE TEST (overwrite state)
### =========================

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v4/travel?sessionId=user1&days=4
Content-Type: text/plain
Accept: application/json

Extend my trip and add Osaka nightlife

### =========================
### V5 - AGENTIC TESTS
### =========================

### Tokyo (standard case)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v5/travel?destination=Tokyo&days=3
Accept: application/json

###

### Paris (tool-heavy reasoning)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v5/travel?destination=Paris&days=4
Accept: application/json

###

### Rome (cultural + food tools)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v5/travel?destination=Rome&days=2
Accept: application/json

###

### Edge case city (fallback tool behavior)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v5/travel?destination=Atlantis&days=3
Accept: application/json

###

### Stress test (consistency check)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v5/travel?destination=Tokyo&days=5
Accept: application/json
